+# Proposal
+
+## Why
+
+Teams moving to Tidy Tasks from spreadsheets have many tasks to bring over; adding them one by one is slow. They need a bulk import from plain text.
+
+## What Changes
+
+- Add a public helper `importTasks(list, text)`, exported from `src/index.ts`.
+- Each non-blank line of `text` is `title;priority;tags`: priority may be empty (normal), tags are space-separated.
+- Every valid line is added to the list; the helper returns `{ imported, rejected }`, where `rejected` lists `{ line, reason }` for each line that could not be added (`line` counts from 1).
+
+## Capabilities
+
+### New Capabilities
+- `task-import`: bulk import of tasks from text, one task per line.
+
+### Modified Capabilities
+
+## Impact
+
+- New `src/domain/import.ts` (pure, returns results, no clock or randomness) and an export in `src/index.ts`.
+- New tests in `test/`. No new dependency; existing `add` behavior is unchanged.
